{"hw":"χρῆ2","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">χρῆ2</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">χρῆ</span>, <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">χρῆς</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3</span> </span> and <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2</span> </span> pers. sg. <span class=\"lex-gram\">pres.</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\">indic.</span> of a defect. verb, expld. by <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hsch.</span> </span> and Sch.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ant.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">887</span> </span> by <span class=\"gk\">θέλει χρῄζει, θέλεις χρῄζεις</span> and found in the following passages: <span class=\"gk\">εἴτε χρῇ θανεῖν</span> whether she <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">desires</b> to die, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ant.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">887</span> </span> (<span class=\"gk\">χρή</span> codd., cf. Sch.ad loc.); <span class=\"gk\">σοὶ δὲ δρᾶν ἔξεσθ' ἃ χρῇς</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Aj.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1373</span> </span> (<span class=\"gk\">χρή</span> codd.); <span class=\"gk\">εἴτε χρῇς</span> (sc. <span class=\"gk\">κηρύσσειν με</span>) <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">El.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">606</span> </span> (<span class=\"gk\">χρή</span> codd.); <span class=\"gk\">πρὸς ταῦθ' ὅ τι χρῇ καὶ παλαμάσθων</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Fr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">918</span> </span> (anap., <span class=\"gk\">χρή</span> codd.); <span class=\"gk\">πάρα δ' ἄλλ' ὅ τι χρῇς</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Cratin.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">127</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Eup.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4</span> </span> (prob. l.); <span class=\"gk\">οὐ χρῆσθα</span> (sc. <span class=\"gk\">φωνεῖν</span>); <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ach.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">778</span> </span> (Megarian). (Cogn. with <span class=\"gk\">χρή, κέχρημαι</span> 'I yearn after', <span class=\"gk\">χρῄζω.</span>)</div></div>"}